{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfCy57suHN859UYmEhz5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The core flows work: the pitch leads to the end screen, idle attract starts after 10 seconds, the AI walks and talks, and any key returns to the title. Two things need checking:\n\n- The AI stalls at (220,152), beside a desk, after its bar visit. Its route to the conference room is not being followed.\n- The pitch scored 0 on that run. The three timed presses may simply have missed the zone, which is plausible, but I want to confirm the reel is right.\n\nFirst, the `FlowField` API."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4665,"cache_read_input_tokens":177245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4665,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a5e6f5c-3967-4e9e-a458-94f8949fc080","uuid":"ef1d049d-8fb1-423e-963c-3bff08aa4576","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:29:32.234Z","request_id":"req_011CgfCy4kYgAraXArcRC1Pa"}
